<title>INDIA: TABLE-India April cement output falls to 6.0 mln T.</title>
<headline>TABLE-India April cement output falls to 6.0 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's cement production fell to 6.0 million tonnes in April from 6.4 million in the same month in 1996, the government said on Thursday</p>
<p>    CEMENT PRODUCTION    April     April    Apr-Mar    Apr-Mar</p>
<p>				  1997	1996    1996/97    1995/96</p>
<p>			     6,007.0   6,355.0   76,176.0   69,550.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes unless stated and preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
